*.pyc

# Standalone MuJoCo side of the repo. All three are derived or fetched, and all
# three are large: the venv, the pinned upstream clones, and the meshes
# converted out of them. `python -m predictive_replanning.assets` rebuilds
# assets/ from third_party/, and assets/PROVENANCE.json records the commit and
# SHA-256 each mesh came from, so what is not committed is still pinned.
.venv/
third_party/
assets/
